      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "• High Temp or Sanitize has been selected and the cycle is extended to heat water. • Check to see that the incoming water temperature is 120° F (49° C).\n• Run dishes being held in the dishwasher through a Rinse Only cycle. • Many dishwashers have a “new” smell when first installed. This will dissipate with use. • Dishwasher may not be draining properly. (See “Dishwasher Will Not Drain” section.) • For a strong odor, place baking soda in both sides of the detergent cup.",
